      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Titagarh Rail Systems from ₹1,037 to ₹971, reflecting updated assumptions on revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E multiples. What's in the News Titagarh Rail Systems received a Letter of Intent from JSW Port Logistics for the manufacture and supply of 720 wagons, a domestic order valued at ₹2,263.5 million.",
